[i][DEMO GIF SLOT — reload-abort clip goes here at publish][/i]

Smarter combat-time weapon choices for the [b]Combat Extended[/b] + [b]Simple Sidearms[/b] combination. Installing the mod turns them on; every feature has its own toggle.

[h1]What it does[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Reload-abort when threatened.[/b] A pawn caught mid-reload with a hostile in effective range draws a loaded backup instead of finishing the reload. Reloads you ordered yourself are never interrupted.
[*][b]Target-aware weapon choice.[/b] When drawing a gun against a target, the CURRENTLY-LOADED ammo's effectiveness against that target counts — penetration vs armor, EMP vs mechs. Never switches or reloads ammo behind your back.
[*][b]Armor-aware melee choice.[/b] Blunt weapons against armor plate, fast blades against flesh.
[*][b]Ammo-depth tiebreak.[/b] When two guns rank about equally, prefer the one with deeper reserves.
[*][b]Forced-weapon dry fall-through[/b] [i](OFF by default)[/i]. Under CE your forced weapon can run completely dry — something the order never anticipated. This toggle picks the reading you meant: "hold it no matter what" (default) or "prefer it while usable." A one-time Learning Helper note explains the choice the first time you force a weapon.
[/list]

[h1]Requires[/h1]
Harmony, Combat Extended, Simple Sidearms, and the [url=https://github.com/eebette/CombatExtended-SimpleSidearms-Compatibility-Patch]CombatExtended-SimpleSidearms Compatibility Patch[/url]. Load after all four (auto-sorted).

[h1]Good to know[/h1]
[list]
[*]Safe to add or remove mid-save — this mod stores nothing in your save.
[*]Weapon selection only ever acts FOR the target the game or you already chose; it never picks targets.
[/list]

[h1]The suite[/h1]
Core: [b]CombatExtended-SimpleSidearms Compatibility Patch[/b] (repairs, required). Sibling: [b]Compatibility Module - Loadouts[/b] (CE loadouts and SS memory as one model).

